{"repo":{"slug":"dacode","name":"dacode","path":"/repos/dacode","registered_at":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},"counters":{"epic":6,"task":33,"decision":5,"doc":14},"epics":[{"id":"dacode:E1","repo":"dacode","title":"recipe file format","description":"the dacode board's §5 milestone M0","status":"closed","references":[]},{"id":"dacode:E2","repo":"dacode","title":"search index","description":"the dacode board's §5 milestone M1","status":"in_work","references":[]},{"id":"dacode:E3","repo":"dacode","title":"shopping-list export","description":"the dacode board's §5 milestone M2","status":"deferred","references":[]},{"id":"dacode:E4","repo":"dacode","title":"archive format","description":"the dacode board's §5 milestone M4","status":"blocked","references":[]},{"id":"dacode:E5","repo":"dacode","title":"Follow-ups","description":"the dacode board's §6 open follow-ups, not tied to a milestone","status":"open","references":[]},{"id":"dacode:E6","repo":"dacode","title":"Spec deltas","description":"the dacode board's A-register design deltas","status":"open","references":[]}],"tasks":[{"id":"dacode:U1","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Cache the parsed recipe file","body":"**U1 · Cache the parsed recipe file.** The loader re-reads the\n      whole corpus on every query; cache the parsed form and invalidate\n      on the file's modified time. overdue by M2 is prose, not an\n      assertion.\n","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U2","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Warm the index at startup","body":"**U2 · Warm the index at startup.** ▶️ started — the first pass\n      builds the index lazily, which makes the first query slow.","status":"in_work","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U3","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Rank by ingredient overlap","body":"**U4 · Rank by ingredient\n      overlap.** blocked on U5 — the index must carry ingredient terms\n      before ranking can be measured.","status":"blocked","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":"      overlap.** blocked on U5 — the index must carry ingredient terms","references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U4","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Normalise ingredient names","body":"**U5 · Normalise ingredient names. ✅ done 2026-10-02** the loader\n      lowercases names and trims whitespace.","status":"closed","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":"**U5 · Normalise ingredient names. ✅ done 2026-10-02** the loader","note":null,"references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U5","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Drop empty recipes at load","body":"**U6 · ⚠️ Drop empty recipes at load.** The loader refuses a recipe\n      with no ingredients; the test corpus carries one. unblocked on\n      U5 is prose; the item is already closed.","status":"closed","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":"imported checked","note":null,"references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U6","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Cache warm-up","body":"**U7 · Cache warm-up ✅ verified by hand.** gates M8 in the plan\n      notes, but no such milestone exists.\n   - [ ] **U8 · An indented checkbox is body text.** It must not parse\n         as a register line.\n","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U7","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Emit a shopping list","body":"**U9 · Emit a shopping list.** blocked on B1 — the loader's\n      format decides what can be exported. The list is grouped by\n      ingredient and keeps the recipe as a trailing note.","status":"blocked","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":"**U9 · Emit a shopping list.** blocked on B1 — the loader's","references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U8","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Archive a recipe box","body":"**U10 · Archive a recipe box.** blocked on A3 — the archive header\n      rides the search delta. The writer stays behind the loader's\n      parsed form so an archive never carries unvalidated text.","status":"blocked","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":"**U10 · Archive a recipe box.** blocked on A3 — the archive header","references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U9","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Add a `--dry-run` flag","body":"**U12 · Add a `--dry-run` flag.** blocked on M1 — the design of\n      the flag belongs to the index pass. The flag must print the same\n      lines the real run would write, in the same order.","status":"blocked","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":"**U12 · Add a `--dry-run` flag.** blocked on M1 — the design of","references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U10","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Share a recipe box","body":"**U15 · Share a recipe box. 🧠 needs a threat model** — sharing is\n      deferred until the export shapes settle, and it is the one item\n      that would need a network surface the project does not have.","status":"deferred","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":"**U15 · Share a recipe box. 🧠 needs a threat model** — sharing is","references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U11","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Tune the ingredient cache","body":"**U17 · Tune the ingredient cache.** due by M4 in the planning\n      note, which is prose here rather than a dependency. The cache is\n      a plain map and the tuning is a measurement, not a design.","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U12","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"Record the loader's parse errors","body":"**U18 · Record the loader's parse errors.** blocked on B9 — the\n      error shape was proposed but no such decision exists, so this is\n      recorded as a finding rather than an edge.\n","status":"blocked","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":"**U18 · Record the loader's parse errors.** blocked on B9 — the","references":[],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U13","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E1","kind":"gate","title":"M0.1","body":"the recipe file reader","status":"closed","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- format`","evidence":"imported: parent milestone M0 complete","note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M0.1","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U14","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E1","kind":"gate","title":"M0.2","body":"the round-trip corpus","status":"closed","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- roundtrip`","evidence":"imported: parent milestone M0 complete","note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M0.2","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U15","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E2","kind":"gate","title":"M1.1","body":"the inverted index","status":"open","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- index`","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M1.1","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U16","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E2","kind":"gate","title":"M1.2","body":"the query parser","status":"open","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- query | tee query.log`","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M1.2","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U17","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E3","kind":"gate","title":"M2.1","body":"the shopping-list template","status":"open","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- export`","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M2.1","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U18","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E4","kind":"gate","title":"M4.1","body":"the archive writer","status":"open","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- archive`","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M4.1","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U19","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E4","kind":"gate","title":"M4.2","body":"the restore check","status":"open","verify":"`cargo test -p recipe-box -- restore`","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M4.2","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U20","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"task","title":"the recipe loader","body":"\nThe loader reads one recipe per file, validates the header, and keeps\nthe ingredient order as written. The validation names the file and the\nline, and a rejected recipe never reaches the index.\n","status":"closed","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":"APPLIED 2026-10-02: : landed with its round-trip test","note":null,"references":[{"kind":"spec","target":"§3.1","note":null},{"kind":"spec","target":"§3.2","note":null},{"kind":"other","target":"A1","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U21","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"task","title":"the inverted index","body":"\nBuild the index from the loader's terms; no ranking in the first pass.\nThe index is a map from term to recipe id, rebuilt on demand, and the\ndelta deliberately does not make it persistent.\n","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"spec","target":"§4.1","note":null},{"kind":"other","target":"A2","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U22","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"task","title":"the query parser","body":"\nThe parser landed for ingredient terms; phrase queries remain open, so\nthe delta is half-applied. The remaining half is the phrase syntax and\nits tests, not a change to the first half's shapes.\n","status":"in_work","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"spec","target":"§4.2","note":null},{"kind":"spec","target":"§5.1","note":null},{"kind":"other","target":"A3","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-04T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-04T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U23","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"task","title":"the archive header","body":"\nThe header borrows the loader's format field, and its span carries no\ncolon, so the task takes the whole span as its title and no section\nreferences. This dossier also carries no index row: the cross-check is\none-directional, so dossiers may exceed the tables.\n","status":"closed","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":"APPLIED 2026-10-06","note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"A6","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U24","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"task","title":"the ingredient cache","body":"\nThe cache is a plain map keyed by ingredient name, rebuilt whenever the\nloader's output changes. The index row names M2 as its dependency, but\na milestone is never a legal edge target, so the assertion is recorded\nas a finding instead.\n\n## Deltas applied\n\n| # | Section | Applied | Date | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ~~**A1**~~ | §3.1, §3.2 | **The recipe loader** | 2026-10-02 | applied with its test |\n| ~~**A3**~~ | §4.2, §5.1 | **The query parser** | 2026-10-04 | first half only |","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"spec","target":"§6.3","note":null},{"kind":"other","target":"A7","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U25","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"task","title":"B1a","body":"B1a (`recipe::Format`) is **done** — the loader parses every recipe in the\nsample corpus and its round-trip test is green.","status":"closed","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":"B1a (`recipe::Format`) is **done** — the loader parses every recipe in the\nsample corpus and its round-trip test is green.","note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"B1","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U26","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"finding","title":"A3 depends on B9","body":"**The query parser**","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"A3","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U27","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E6","kind":"finding","title":"A7 depends on M2","body":"**The ingredient cache**","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"A7","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U28","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"finding","title":"B6 gates M9","body":"\nMetric units in the first release; the unit table is a plain list and\nno conversion is attempted. The Gates cell names a milestone that this\nboard does not carry, so the assertion is recorded as a finding rather\nthan silently dropped.","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"B6","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U29","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"finding","title":"U7 gates M8","body":"**U7 · Cache warm-up ✅ verified by hand.** gates M8 in the plan","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"U7","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U30","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"finding","title":"U12 blocked on M1","body":"**U12 · Add a `--dry-run` flag.** blocked on M1 — the design of","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"U12","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U31","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"finding","title":"U17 gates M4","body":"**U17 · Tune the ingredient cache.** due by M4 in the planning","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"U17","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U32","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E5","kind":"finding","title":"U18 blocked on B9","body":"**U18 · Record the loader's parse errors.** blocked on B9 — the","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"U18","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:U33","repo":"dacode","epic":"dacode:E3","kind":"finding","title":"M2 gates M4","body":"      gates M4: the export cannot ship before the archive header is","status":"open","verify":"imported: the board's checkbox and discharge marker","evidence":null,"note":null,"references":[{"kind":"other","target":"M2","note":null}],"priority":null,"until":null,"estimate":null,"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"}],"decisions":[{"id":"dacode:D1","repo":"dacode","title":"Recipe file format","status":"signed","options":[],"recommendation":null,"resolution":"the plain-text format adopted","confidence":"medium","references":[{"kind":"doc","target":"dacode:S3","note":null},{"kind":"doc","target":"dacode:S5","note":null}],"created":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:D2","repo":"dacode","title":"Export formats","status":"signed","options":[],"recommendation":null,"resolution":"two shapes for the first release","confidence":"medium","references":[{"kind":"doc","target":"05","note":null},{"kind":"doc","target":"dacode:S13","note":null}],"created":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:D3","repo":"dacode","title":"Search index","status":"signed","options":[],"recommendation":null,"resolution":"the inverted index stands","confidence":"medium","references":[{"kind":"doc","target":"dacode:S3","note":null},{"kind":"doc","target":"dacode:S6","note":null}],"created":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:D4","repo":"dacode","title":"Archive format","status":"signed","options":[],"recommendation":null,"resolution":"as a direction, amended — one tar file, no compression","confidence":"medium","references":[{"kind":"doc","target":"05","note":null}],"created":"2026-09-28T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-09-28T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:D5","repo":"dacode","title":"Unit labels","status":"signed","options":[],"recommendation":null,"resolution":"metric only","confidence":"medium","references":[{"kind":"doc","target":"dacode:S14","note":null}],"created":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000000000Z"}],"docs":[{"id":"dacode:S1","repo":"dacode","title":"README","path":"docs/implementation/README.md","version":"expanded","references":[],"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:S2","repo":"dacode","title":"00-overview","path":"docs/implementation/00-overview.md","version":"expanded","references":[],"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:S3","repo":"dacode","title":"01","path":"docs/implementation/01.md","version":"expanded","references":[],"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:S4","repo":"dacode","title":"02","path":"docs/implementation/02.md","version":"expanded","references":[],"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"},{"id":"dacode:S5","repo":"dacode","title":"03","path":"docs/implementation/03.md","version":"expanded","references":[],"created":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000000000Z"